@baseUrl = http://localhost:8082
@userId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@vendorId = bbbbbbbb-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@hubId = 33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333
@orderId = aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa

### 주문 생성

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-User-Role: MASTER
X-Hub-Id: {{hubId}}
X-Vendor-Id: {{vendorId}}

{
  "productId": "44ef6a7b-8c9d-4012-a345-67890abcdef1",
  "productName": "유기농 우유",

  "requestVendorId": "44d6507c-9b8e-4a6c-9f8d-4e92b3a1a004",
  "requestVendorName": "마켓컬리 신선센터",
  "requestVendorHubId": "d4e5f6a7-b8c9-0123-4567-890abcdef123",
  "requestVendorHubName": "요청허브A",

  "receiverVendorId": "cccccccc-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "receiverVendorName": "수령업체B",
  "receiverVendorHubId": "eeeeeeee-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "receiverVendorHubName": "수령허브B",

  "quantity": 1,
  "requestNote": "빠른 배송 부탁드립니다"
}

### 단건 조회

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/6a9ac0ef-7c43-4cb2-bec2-23fdf49ed3d9
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Role: MASTER
X-Hub-Id: {{hubId}}
X-Vendor-Id: {{vendorId}}

### 커서 조회 기본

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders?cursor=null&size=10
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Role: MASTER
X-Hub-Id: {{hubId}}
X-Vendor-Id: {{vendorId}}

### 커서 + 조건 조회

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders?cursor=2024-01-01T00:00:00&size=10&requestVendorId={{vendorId}}&status=CREATED
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Role: MASTER
X-Hub-Id: {{hubId}}
X-Vendor-Id: {{vendorId}}

### 주문 수정
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/6a9ac0ef-7c43-4cb2-bec2-23fdf49ed3d9
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Role: MASTER
X-Hub-Id: {{hubId}}
X-Vendor-Id: {{vendorId}}

{
  "requestNote": "배송 메모 수정0405",
  "quantity": 20
}

### SOFT - DELETE
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Role: MASTER
X-Hub-Id: {{hubId}}
X-Vendor-Id: {{vendorId}}

### CANCEL
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Role: MASTER
X-Vendor-Id: {{vendorId}}
X-Hub-Id: {{hubId}}